{"TELL_JOKE","st=friendly,neutral",{"A rooster, a postman and a deacon share a ride - the rooster gets out first, that's the joke","I'd tell you about my cooking, but I don't want to frighten you","I used to be late for everything. Finally found an occasion I would've liked to miss","I'm saving my good joke for a better audience. That's what I tell everyone","My talent is remembering the joke right after everyone leaves","I was going to make one about my prospects. Even I thought that was depressing","You'd think I'd finally have time to get interesting. Apparently not","My mother said I'd be the death of her. Never had much faith in my timing","I can do the polite laugh if you want to try first","I forgot the ending. That's the nicest thing I could've done for that joke"}},
{"TELL_JOKE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"What's the difference between a zombie and a politician?","Why did the chicken cross the road?","Knock knock","A man walks into a bar","How many survivors does it take to change a light bulb?","I was going to tell you a joke about the apocalypse","Know what I miss? Reality TV, no wait, I don't, I never watched it","Yo mama's so slow, she'd get caught by a zombie","What do you call a zombie that doesn't bite?","Last week I told my wife she was beautiful, and she said","I kissed a guy the other day, turns out he was infected, hahaha!","Why don't zombies eat clowns?","I asked my husband for a divorce, and he said","What do you call a zombie who's good at golf?","Why did the scarecrow win an award?","I told my wife she was drawing her eyebrows too high","Why don't skeletons fight each other?","I'm reading a book on anti-gravity","What's the best thing about Switzerland?","I used to hate facial hair","Why did the tomato blush?","My dog ate a clock","I'd tell you a joke about construction","How do you organize a space party?","A man walked into a library and asked for a book on paranoia","I stayed up all night wondering where the sun went","Man says 'doc, it hurts when I do this', doc says 'then don't do that', I think about that every step I take","What's the difference between a zombie and a Monday morning? Nothing, they both make me want to bite someone","My wife says I have no sense of direction, so I packed up my things and right now I'm... wait, where am I?","I'd tell you a construction joke, but I'm still working on it, ha, ha, get it?","Why don't scientists trust atoms? Because they make up everything, and I'd like to make up a better world","Two peanuts walked down a dark alley, one was a-salted, I'm so sorry, I haven't had coffee","I used to hate facial hair, but then it grew on me, thank you, thank you, I'm here all week","Know what's the worst thing about the apocalypse? No cable, and now nobody's even fighting over the remote","Why did the chicken cross the road? To get to the other side, and not get eaten, which is the harder part","What do you call a fake noodle? An impasta, my daughter taught me that one, God, I miss her","My grandpa told me: son, always keep a joke in your pocket, so here, I give you my last one: knock knock"},false,false,{[1]={{t="The zombie has a better attendance record",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="To get away from the dead, obviously",afterMs=3000}},[3]={{t="Who's there? ... right, no one's there, no one's ever there",afterMs=2500}},[4]={{t="The bar's gone, and so is the man, ha",afterMs=3000}},[5]={{t="None, there's no electricity, ha ha ha",afterMs=3500}},[6]={{t="But it's not funny anymore",afterMs=3000}},[8]={{t="Sorry, that was in poor taste, she's fine, I hope",afterMs=3000}},[9]={{t="Vegetarian, ha, ha, I've been waiting for that one",afterMs=3000}},[10]={{t="\"You must be starving\"",afterMs=3500}},[11]={{t="I wonder if I'm infected as well",afterMs=3200}},[12]={{t="They taste funny",afterMs=3000}},[13]={{t="\"I'm dead, you're too late\"",afterMs=3200}},[14]={{t="a dead shot",afterMs=3000}},[15]={{t="he was outstanding in his field",afterMs=3000},{t="it's an old one, I'm out of new",afterMs=2800}},[16]={{t="she looked surprised",afterMs=3200}},[17]={{t="they don't have the guts",afterMs=3000}},[18]={{t="it's impossible to put down",afterMs=3200}},[19]={{t="I don't know, but the flag is a big plus",afterMs=3000}},[20]={{t="but then it grew on me",afterMs=3200}},[21]={{t="it saw the salad dressing",afterMs=3000}},[22]={{t="it was time consuming..",afterMs=3200}},[23]={{t="but I'm still working on it",afterMs=3000}},[24]={{t="you planet",afterMs=3000}},[25]={{t="the librarian whispered \"it's right behind you\"",afterMs=3200}},[26]={{t="then it dawned on me",afterMs=3500}},[28]={{t="Ha, ha, I'll be here all week",afterMs=3500}}}},
